{
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-0.char": "引我至此的火焰仍在燃烧。我不会被拒之门外。",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "继续",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-1.ancient": "一个与火同行的佣兵。多么……勤勉。你真的以为你的余烬能烧毁我所建立的一切？",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-1.next": "继续",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-2.char": "我不只是以为。我会证明给你看。",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-attack": "BOTH",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "又回来了，小火焰？你的执着……令人注目。",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.1-0r.next": "继续",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.1-1r.char": "执着是我仅有的东西。这已经足够了。",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.1-1r.next": "继续",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.1-2r.ancient": "那就让我看看它能持续多久。",

    "DARV.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-0.ancient": "哎呀呀！一个血管里流淌着火焰的佣兵！来吧，看看我的货物——每样东西都有个价。",
    "DARV.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "继续",
    "DARV.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-1.char": "我跟商人打过交道。给我看看你有什么。",
    "DARV.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-1.next": "继续",
    "DARV.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-2.ancient": "哈！直截了当！我就喜欢这样的顾客！",
    "DARV.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "又回来啦，火焰佣兵？货堆已经补了新的。来看看吧！",

    "NEOW.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-0.ancient": "……一个与火同行的人……你知晓……这轮回……如同我……",
    "NEOW.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "继续",
    "NEOW.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-1.char": "我不懂你的轮回。我只知道我的任务。",
    "NEOW.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-1.next": "继续",
    "NEOW.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-2.ancient": "……那就去……寻找……建筑师……终结……该终结之物……",
    "NEOW.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "……仍在燃烧……很好……",

    "PAEL.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-0.ancient": "一团不安的火焰……坐下，歇歇……让余烬沉淀……",
    "PAEL.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "继续",
    "PAEL.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-1.char": "任务完成之前我不会歇息。但我接受你的馈赠。",
    "PAEL.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-1.next": "继续",
    "PAEL.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-2.ancient": "如此执着……好吧，拿上这个……",
    "PAEL.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "执着的火焰回来了……歇一会儿……然后拿走你需要的……",

    "TANX.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-0.ancient": "你的武器呢！？真正的战士需要真正的钢铁！！",
    "TANX.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "继续",
    "TANX.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-1.char": "我的火焰就是我所需要的一切。",
    "TANX.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-1.next": "继续",
