    "TANX.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "火焰战士回来了！！还是不带刀刃！！依然强大！！",

    "VAKUU.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-0.ancient": "一个驾驭火焰与钢铁的佣兵……我能给你远超于此的力量。在此签字。",
    "VAKUU.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "继续",
    "VAKUU.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-1.char": "我见过够多的契约，一眼就能看出坏交易。不行。",
    "VAKUU.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-1.next": "继续",
    "VAKUU.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-2.ancient": "可惜。要改变主意的话，提议仍然有效。",
    "VAKUU.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "还抱着你的火焰不放？契约在等着你……",

    "OROBAS.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-0.ancient": "哦！！火！！好亮！！好闪！！这个闪的也拿走！！",
    "OROBAS.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "继续",
    "OROBAS.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-1.char": "我不是来捡亮闪闪的。但我不会拒绝你的馈赠。",
    "OROBAS.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-1.next": "继续",
    "OROBAS.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-2.ancient": "火焰朋友拿了闪闪的！！好！！再给火焰朋友更多闪闪的！！",
    "OROBAS.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "火焰朋友回来了！！找到更多闪闪的！！你看看你看看！！",

    "TEZCATARA.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-0.ancient": "过来一些，亲爱的。我的眼神不太好使，但我能感受到你内心的那团火。",
    "TEZCATARA.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "继续",
    "TEZCATARA.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-1.char": "我保持距离，谢了。你有什么可提供的？",
    "TEZCATARA.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-1.next": "继续",
    "TEZCATARA.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-2.ancient": "多么炽热的小火焰。让我为你添些柴吧，亲爱的。",
    "TEZCATARA.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "这么快就回来啦，小余烬？来，让那火透透气吧……",

    "NONUPEIPE.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-0.ancient": "一位身披火焰的朝圣者！多么雅致！过来，接受我的赐福吧。",
