    "NONUPEIPE.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-1.char": "我不是朝圣者。但我接受一切帮助。",
    "NONUPEIPE.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-1.next": "继续",
    "NONUPEIPE.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.0-2.ancient": "一位知道自己需要什么的战士！真难得！那就拿上这个吧。",
    "NONUPEIPE.talk.REED_CHARACTER_REED_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "火焰战士回来了。穿戴上这些礼物吧，旅人。"
